#
# Description:
#   Validates the synthetic mission profile generated by simulate_flight.py
#   before it is supplied to the actual C flight-software modules.
#
#   The test verifies:
#
#       - Complete mission phase sequence
#       - Expected ascent altitude
#       - Valid release/freefall event
#       - Recovery trigger conditions
#       - Recovery response-time budget
#       - Descent and landing
#       - Basic GNSS validity
#       - Basic environmental sensor sanity
#
#   This test does NOT reproduce FlightState or Recovery algorithms. It only
#   confirms that the generated input dataset contains the conditions needed
#   to exercise those algorithms.
#
